<title>GREECE: OTE telecom board approves submarine cable.</title>
<headline>OTE telecom board approves submarine cable.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>OTE telecom's board of directors approved the implementation of the third phase of a submarine cable linkage budgeted at 8.61 billion drachmas, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The project is related to the submarine cable linkage of Lehena, Preveza, it said.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
